  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place potato fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6524ea79e4436936d49a456a-0624981a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons. Thinly slice apple (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• In a large bowl, combine cucumber, apple, slaw mix, mustard cider dressing and half the plant-based smokey aioli. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6524ea79e4436936d49a456a-68cb6cd0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When wedges have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6524ea79e4436936d49a456a-7a688745.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based chick'n tenders, cucumber slaw and herby fries between plates.\n• Serve with remaining plant-based smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6524ea79e4436936d49a456a-c7e3aae6.jpeg"
    }
  ]
